# ECDSA attestation signing keys. security_pki.py generates the pair on first
# use and prefers AG_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PEM from the environment. The private
# key must never enter version control; the directory is regenerated per
# environment, so both files are ignored.
backend/certs/

# Scratch intermediates. The generator (build_9day_addendum.py) IS versioned -
# it is the source of the Addendum B workbook - but everything else in scratch/
# is a throwaway: staged render, one-off patch scripts, inspection helpers,
# docx-repair working directories and invoice binaries.
scratch/*
!scratch/build_9day_addendum.py

# Root-level SAST analysis scratch files (generated during remediation workflow)
scratch_*.json
scratch_*.py
scratch_*.txt

# Excel owner files
~$*.xlsx
~$*.docx

# Local inspection scratch — do not publish
check_sections.py
find_spacing.py
spacing_results.txt

# Markdown kept local; do not publish these artefacts
DEMO_RUNBOOK.md
docs/SITA_POC_END_TO_END_DEMO_RUNBOOK.md
reports/INV-2026-010_October_Invoice.md

# Dev-only: test fixtures, synthetic data generators, and SQL seed files
